  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small communities sanitation &#x2013; Dutch consultant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch consultant will be building feasible scenarios to improve the sanitation coverage of small communities in Egypt, as well as testing its implementation potential in different geographic contexts in Egypt. The consultant will evaluate and validate these scenarios, in terms of financial viability and sustainability, in order to explore the potential for their translation to other rural small communities in Egypt. For this aim, it&apos;s important that the Dutch consultant cooperates with a local consultant, specialised in local data in the same field.The project builds upon an earlier study called &quot;Final Reconnaissance Study Innovative Sanitation Facilities Egypt v1.2&quot;.This study may provide essential building blocks to speed-up the process of scenario building.</narrative>
  </description>
